---
import { site } from '../config/site';
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---
<Layout title="Affiliate disclosure" description="How Pickora's affiliate links work and how recommendations are selected."><div class="wrap page-shell"><Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Affiliate disclosure' }]} /><article class="prose-page"><p class="eyebrow">Transparency matters</p><h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1><p class="lead">Some links on Pickora may be affiliate links. If you use one and make a qualifying purchase, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.</p><p>When a recommendation contains affiliate links, we place a notice near those links so you can make an informed choice. The presence of a commission does not guarantee a product recommendation or determine our editorial conclusions.</p><div class="required-statement"><span class="eyebrow">Amazon Associates disclosure</span><strong>{site.amazonAssociateStatement}</strong></div><p>Amazon and the Amazon logo are trademarks of Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates. Pickora is an independent publication and is not affiliated with, sponsored by or endorsed by Amazon or any other retailer.</p><h2>How recommendations work</h2><p>Our goal is to publish useful original context: who a product may suit, what selection criteria matter, and what limitations to consider. We do not invent product reviews, prices, discounts, specifications, availability or personal testing. Product links are published only after the destination and applicable affiliate link have been verified.</p><p>Retailer prices and availability can change. Unless explicitly supported by a current permitted source, we do not claim a current price or stock status. Any future price information will be dated and handled according to the retailer program’s rules.</p><h2>Questions or corrections</h2><p>For details about how we evaluate content, read the <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a>. Contact details will appear on the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> when a monitored address is configured.</p></article></div></Layout>
